# Applies to: ~/.espressif/esp-matter (components/esp_matter/Kconfig)
#
# esp-matter's SEC_CERT_DAC_PROVIDER collides with the identically-named
# symbol declared in
# connectedhomeip/config/esp32/components/chip/Kconfig:903, a duplicate
# Kconfig symbol that breaks menuconfig/sdkconfig generation. Still present
# on esp-matter release/v1.6 as of 2026-09-02. Rename esp-matter's copy to
# ESP_MATTER_SEC_CERT_DAC_PROVIDER to disambiguate.
#
# Note: esp_matter_providers.cpp still reads CONFIG_SEC_CERT_DAC_PROVIDER
# (the connectedhomeip symbol), so esp-matter's own secure-cert DAC
# provider option is effectively dead after this rename. Harmless for this
# project, which uses CONFIG_EXAMPLE_DAC_PROVIDER=y instead.
#
# Apply from ~/.espressif/esp-matter with:
#   git apply patches/esp-matter-kconfig-sec-cert-rename.patch
diff --git a/components/esp_matter/Kconfig b/components/esp_matter/Kconfig
index ed8f563e..8f0bdbdd 100644
--- a/components/esp_matter/Kconfig
+++ b/components/esp_matter/Kconfig
@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@ menu "ESP Matter"
             help
                 An implementation which reads attestation information from the factory partition

-        config SEC_CERT_DAC_PROVIDER
+        config ESP_MATTER_SEC_CERT_DAC_PROVIDER
             bool "Attestation - Secure Cert"
             help
                 An implementation which reads attestation information from the esp_secure_cert partition
